  "bio": "Mards is a highly skilled tattoo artist known for their proficiency in 'fineline' and 'sketch' styles that bring art to life on skin. Their dedication to their craft is reflected in the detail and precision of each tattoo they create. If you're looking for an artist who can translate intricate designs into stunning body art, Mards at Society Studios in Hull is certainly one to consider—reach out via direct message for appointments and explore their work at @mards.attacks on Instagram.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location:\n\nHull - @society.studios \nDM for appointments\n@mards.attacks\nPrints & Tee's available -\n\nHull - @society.studios \nDM for appointments\n@mards.attacks\nPrints & Tee's available -",
